Package: stepcadence
Title: Computes Cadence Metrics from Step Count Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Angela", "Zhao", , "azhaowork@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("John", "Muschelli", , "muschellij2@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Computes cadence (steps per minute) metrics from minute-level
    step count data, such as data from the National Health and Nutrition
    Examination Survey (NHANES), as described in Tudor-Locke et al. (2018)
    <doi:10.1136/bjsports-2017-097628>. Metrics include peak 1-, 30-, and
    60-minute cadence, maximum 5-, 20-, 30-, and 60-minute consecutive
    cadence, uncensored and censored mean cadence, and time spent in
    cadence bands and levels, with optional masking of non-wear time.
